  "bodyText": "Portfolio\nExperience \nLand\nArchitecture\nInteriors\nYour experience\nPractice \nAbout us\nMeet The Team\nStrategic Management\nSustainability\nFilms\nRecognition\nContact us \nGet in touch\nCareers\nRegion \nRob Mills Architecture & Interiors.\nResidential design specialist.\nLive well\nBrisbane Residence\nHowqua River Lodge\nBahamas Residence\nSydney Residence\nVictoria Road Residence\nBellevue Hill II Residence\nPoint Piper Residence\nBellevue Hill Residence\nHillside Residence\nKenley Court\nNoosa Waters Residence\nRob Mills Architecture & Interiors Woollahra Studio\nByron Bay Residence\nThirty Anderson\nSt Georges Residence\nHampden by RMA\nCarrical\nRMA residences are defined by intelligent architecture, healthy design, a tradition of craftsmanship and a deep connection with nature. A place to live well.\n\nFor over three decades, we have built an enviable reputation as an international, award-winning practice delivering specialist land, architecture, interior design and strategic management services under one roof.\n\nRead more\nThe essence of every great home is drawn from the quality of the land.\nRead more\nLand\nArchitecture\nInteriors\nStrategic Management\nSustainability\nHealthy materials and enduring value drive our design.\nRead more\nFilms\nOn the luxury of space in contemporary residences.\nWatch films\nCareers\nLet's create something exceptional. Let's work together.\nJoin us\nSocials\nOur patrons are private. This is a selection of our work.\nFollow us\nArchitects & Interior Designers\nbased in Melbourne, Sydney, Byron Bay, Brisbane and Perth\nSocial\nSearch\nCopyright 2026\nTerms\nSite Map",
